# Data & admin

- ORM: Drizzle su Postgres (`DATABASE_URL` / `POSTGRES_URL`)
- Schema tipico: `events` (incl. campi i18n + URL volantino Blob), `members`, opz. `users` admin
- Auth: cookie httpOnly firmato (`AUTH_SECRET`) + `ADMIN_EMAIL` / `ADMIN_PASSWORD_HASH` (o tabella users 1–2 record)
- Upload media: `@vercel/blob` (`BLOB_READ_WRITE_TOKEN`) — volantini eventi e simili
- Form contatti: Resend + honeypot + rate limit base
- Mai loggare secret, hash password o connection string
